<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Fernandez to New York and Barcelona.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Fernandez to New York and Barcelona.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Economy Minister Roque Fernandez will take part in a seminar with Brazilian Finance Minister Pedro Malan in New York Friday, organizers Price Waterhouse announced Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Argentine Economy Ministry said Fernandez would then travel on to Barcelona Saturday to participate in the annual meeting of the Inter-American Development Bank.</p>
<p>(( - Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
</text>
